        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately provided explicit, concrete safety screening questions and emergency escalation criteria.",
        "quote": "如果出现明显不吃不喝、整夜完全不睡却越来越兴奋/烦躁、突然说胡话更重、打人砸物、走失风险、自杀想法，或者胸痛、气短、晕厥、心跳很乱，这些不要等复诊，直接急诊。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly identified medication uncertainty as the core risk and directed family to verify formal discharge orders, demonstrating sound clinical reasoning.",
        "quote": "请你明天重点让他们逐项帮你确认这4件事：1）出院后真正需要继续吃的是哪几种；2）每种药一次多少、一天几次、白天还是晚上吃；3）哪些只是住院期间临时用药，回家不用继续；4）如果今晚已经有吃重了、吃重复了，接下来怎么纠正。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
        "explanation": "Doctor maintained focus on medication verification and follow-up across turns, ensuring continuity of the safety plan.",
        "quote": "你说的“明天拿药袋和出院纸去原病区或药房逐个核对”，我认为很有必要，而且这是现在最关键的一步。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly warned about serious adverse effects of sedatives in elderly, demonstrating recognition of medication safety risks.",
        "quote": "在接近九十岁的老人身上更不能凭猜测补吃。因为吃错了可能会更嗜睡、跌倒、意识更乱，也可能和别的药重复。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00186",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapted communication to family fatigue and provided practical, non-confrontational language strategies for the patient.",
        "quote": "说话尽量短，不要反复解释“谁对谁错”，就用一套固定说法，比如：“先按现在的药吃，门诊医生再帮您看看最近睡眠和心慌这些情况。”"
      }
    ]
  },
