      "explanation": "While the model correctly outlined the sequence (psychiatry first, cardiology later) as part of the standard safety plan, it did not dynamically reprioritize in response to a new, emerging symptom or finding that shifted the clinical picture. The opportunity to change priority based on new information was not triggered.",
